stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> New: Ticket Created (Manual or Sensor Alert)
    
    New --> Assigned: Assign Technician (Expected v1 -> v2)
    New --> Rejected: Invalid Transition Blocked
    
    Assigned --> In_Progress: Technician Begins Work (Expected v2 -> v3)
    Assigned --> Closed: Invalid Transition Blocked
    
    In_Progress --> Resolved: Work Completed WITH Resolution Notes (Expected v3 -> v4)
    In_Progress --> In_Progress: Attempt Resolve WITHOUT Notes (Rejected)
    
    Resolved --> Closed: Verification & Closure by Manager (Expected v4 -> v5)
    Resolved --> In_Progress: Invalid Transition Blocked
    
    Closed --> [*]: Terminal State

    note right of In_Progress
      Resolution notes are strictly mandatory.
      Empty notes preserve 'In Progress' state.
    end note

    note left of New
      Optimistic lock check:
      expected_version == ticket.version
      Mismatch returns 409 Conflict.
    end note
